 * its producing parallel subtasks; each of these partitions is furthermore partitioned into one or
 * more subpartitions.
 *
 * <pre>{@code
 *                            Intermediate result
 *               +-----------------------------------------+
 *               |                      +----------------+ |              +-----------------------+
 * +-------+     | +-------------+  +=> | Subpartition 1 | | <=======+=== | Input Gate | Reduce 1 |
 * | Map 1 | ==> | | Partition 1 | =|   +----------------+ |         |    +-----------------------+
 * +-------+     | +-------------+  +=> | Subpartition 2 | | <==+    |
 *               |                      +----------------+ |    |    | Subpartition request
 *               |                                         |    |    |
 *               |                      +----------------+ |    |    |
 * +-------+     | +-------------+  +=> | Subpartition 1 | | <==+====+
 * | Map 2 | ==> | | Partition 2 | =|   +----------------+ |    |         +-----------------------+
 * +-------+     | +-------------+  +=> | Subpartition 2 | | <==+======== | Input Gate | Reduce 2 |
 *               |                      +----------------+ |              +-----------------------+
 *               +-----------------------------------------+
 * }</pre>
 *
