                                AddressDetectionState.SLOW_CONNECT));

        // loop while there is time left
        while (elapsedTimeMillis < maxWaitMillis) {
            boolean logging = elapsedTimeMillis >= startLoggingAfter;
            if (logging) {
                LOG.info("Trying to connect to " + targetAddress);
